#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:16
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Using &konqueror; you can start up an <command>rlogin</command> session with "
"a server hosting the rlogin service."
msgstr ""
"Se emprega &konqueror; pode iniciar unha sesión de <command>rlogin</command> "
"cun servidor que aloxe o servizo rlogin."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:19
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To use this kioslave feature, in the &konqueror; <acronym>URL</acronym> bar, "
"type <userinput>rlogin:/host_to_connect_to</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"Para empregar esta funcionalidade do kioslave, na barra do <acronym>URL</"
"acronym> de &konqueror;, escriba <userinput>rlogin:/servidor</userinput>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:23
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This will initialize &konsole; with an <command>rlogin</command> session, "
"prompting you for your password."
msgstr ""
"Into inicializará &konsole; cunha sesión de <command>rlogin</command>, onde "
"se lle pedirá o seu contrasinal."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:26
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <command>rlogin</command> kioslave uses the username of the account you "
"are currently using in &kde;."
msgstr ""
"O kioslave <command>rlogin</command> emprega o nome de usuario da conta que "
"está a empregar en &kde;."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:29
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"After you have successfully entered your password, you can begin your remote "
"session."
msgstr ""
"Tras inserir correctamente o contrasinal, pode comezar a sesión remota."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:32
#, no-c-format
msgid "See the manual: <ulink url=\"man:/rlogin\">rlogin</ulink>."
msgstr "Consulte o manual <ulink url=\"man:/rlogin\">rlogin</ulink>."
